            "text": "La consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que desglosa el número de pacientes diagnosticados con náuseas (Concept ID 31967) según su género y rango de edad es la siguiente:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    gc.concept_name AS gender,\n    CASE\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM CURRENT_DATE()) - p.year_of_birth) < 18 THEN '0-17'\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM CURRENT_DATE()) - p.year_of_birth) BETWEEN 18 AND 34 THEN '18-34'\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM CURRENT_DATE()) - p.year_of_birth) BETWEEN 35 AND 54 THEN '35-54'\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM CURRENT_DATE()) - p.year_of_birth) BETWEEN 55 AND 74 THEN '55-74'\n        ELSE '75+'\n    END AS age_group,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT p.person_id) AS patient_count\nFROM\n    `condition_occurrence` AS co\nJOIN\n    `person` AS p\nON\n    co.person_id = p.person_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS gc\nON\n    p.gender_concept_id = gc.concept_id\nWHERE\n    co.condition_concept_id = 31967\nGROUP BY\n    gender,\n    age_group\nORDER BY\n    gender,\n    age_group\n```",
